---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Stephen Adams | Law Offices of Joseph A. Simon';
const pageDescription =
  "Above all, Mr. Adams knows that results matter. Working with his clients, Adams develops reasonable goals then passionately seeks to achieve those goals through negotiation or litigation...";
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} headerVariant="transparent">
  <main data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:g8370x">
    <section class="attorney-hero" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:w1knyf">
      <div class="attorney-hero-inner" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:apb95b">
        <nav class="attorney-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:p796qk">
          <a href="/" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:oxzcun">Home</a>
          <span aria-hidden="true" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:bkkl67">/</span>
          <a href="/#about" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:oxzcum">Our Team</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="attorney-eyebrow" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:apb95a">Criminal Defense Attorney - Effective March 1, 2024, Mr. Adams will be of counsel to the Firm.</div>
        <h1 class="attorney-title" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:dnjjjh">Stephen Adams</h1>
        <div class="attorney-hero-actions" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:apb959">
          <a class="attorney-button" href="/#contact" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:oxzcul">Request a Confidential Consultation</a>
          <a class="attorney-phone" href="tel:+17348876200" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:oxzcuk">(734) 887-6200</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="attorney-body" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:apb958">
      <article class="attorney-copy" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:z4uyr">
        <figure class="attorney-figure">
          <img
            src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/ee60f2da/images/stephen-adams-0-652b73-600.webp"
            alt="Stephen Adams, criminal defense attorney"
            width="600"
            height="750"
            loading="lazy" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:kuma3e" />
          <figcaption>Stephen Adams</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <p data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:w1x9k9"><em>Effective March 1, 2024, Mr. Adams will be of counsel to the Firm.</em></p>

        <p data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:w1x9k8">For over thirty years Mr. Adams has practiced criminal law both as a prosecutor and a defender in Federal Court and state courts throughout Southeastern Michigan.&nbsp; He has tried cases involving murder, homicide, criminal sexual conduct, and robbery in addition to domestic violence and drunk driving. &nbsp;A fighter in the courtroom, Mr. Adams is recognized by judges and colleagues as a vigorous advocate committed to representing his clients passionately.&nbsp; He has successfully litigated RICO and drug conspiracies in Federal Court and has argued in Michigan's Court of Appeals and Supreme Court. &nbsp;Mr. Adams brings the same level of commitment and professionalism to delinquency and abuse-neglect proceedings under the Juvenile Code drawing on his years of experience in the Family Division court.&nbsp;</p>

        <p data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:w1x9jm">Mr. Adams attended night classes at Wayne State University working his way through law school as a law clerk to the late Kenneth V. Cockrel, a former Detroit City Council Member.&nbsp; Graduating with honors in the top 16% of his class, Adams joined the Wayne County Prosecutor's Office followed by over twenty-five years as an Assistant Public Defender with the Washtenaw County Public Defender's Office.</p>

        <p data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:w1x9jl">Throughout his career, Mr. Adams has kept pace with the development of police technology such as DNA comparisons and video from body cameras, dashcams, and surveillance cameras.&nbsp; Adams has trained in the use of Call Detail Records to gather location information and has jury trial experience both as a prosecutor presenting cell tower location data as well as a defense attorney proving the limits of its reliability on behalf of a client.</p>

        <p data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:w1x9jk">Above all, Mr. Adams knows that results matter.&nbsp; Working with his clients, Adams develops reasonable goals then passionately seeks to achieve those goals through negotiation or litigation.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="attorney-cta" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:w1knyg">
      <div class="attorney-cta-inner" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:apb957">
        <div class="attorney-cta-eyebrow" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:apb956"><span class="attorney-cta-line" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:bkkl68"></span>Consultation</div>
        <h2 class="attorney-cta-title" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:10vdo4">Whatever the charge, talk to us first.</h2>
        <p class="attorney-cta-text" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:w1x9jj">Your consultation is confidential and available 24/7. Tell us what you're facing and we'll explain how Michigan law applies to it.</p>
        <div class="attorney-cta-buttons" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:apb955">
          <a class="attorney-cta-primary" href="/#contact" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:oxzcuj">
            Request a Confidential Consultation
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="attorney-cta-secondary" href="tel:+17348876200" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:oxzcui">Call (734) 887-6200</a>
        </div>
        <div class="attorney-cta-links" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:apb954">
          <nav class="attorney-cta-nav" aria-label="Quick links" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:lfnjdg">
            <a href="/" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:ejw4a8">Home</a>
            <a href="/practice-areas" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:ejw4a7">Practice Areas</a>
            <a href="/#results" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:ejw4a6">Results</a>
            <a href="/#about" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:ejw4a5">About</a>
            <a href="/#testimonials" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:ejw4a4">Testimonials</a>
            <a href="/#faq" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:ejw4a3">FAQs</a>
            <a href="/#contact" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:ejw4a2">Contact</a>
          </nav>
          <a class="attorney-cta-phone" href="tel:+17348876200" data-ps="src/pages/attorneys/stephen-adams.astro:ejw4a1">Call (734) 887-6200</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .attorney-hero {
    background:
      linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(4, 16, 38, 0.97) 0%, rgba(8, 26, 60, 0.85) 100%),
      url("https://jas-law-astro-review.netlify.app/hero-court-1.webp") 50% 50% / cover no-repeat;
    padding: 120px 24px 80px;
  }
  .attorney-hero-inner {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .attorney-breadcrumbs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 19.5px;
    color: #c3ccda;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .attorney-breadcrumbs a {
    color: #c3ccda;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .attorney-breadcrumbs a:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .attorney-eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 18px;
    letter-spacing: 1.8px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c9a840;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .attorney-eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    width: 28px;
    height: 2px;
    background: #c9a840;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .attorney-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 52px;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 58.24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.6px;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 40px;
  }
  .attorney-hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .attorney-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 16px 30px;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: #732521;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 24px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .attorney-button:hover {
    background: #581b19;
  }
  .attorney-phone {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 24px;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #c9a840;
  }
  .attorney-phone:hover {
    color: #ddc582;
  }

  .attorney-body {
    padding: 64px 24px;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .attorney-copy {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 32.4px;
    color: #454e5e;
    padding-bottom: 96px;
  }
  .attorney-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .attorney-copy em {
    color: #061532;
  }
  .attorney-figure {
    float: left;
    width: 300px;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 8px 40px 16px 0;
  }
  .attorney-figure img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .attorney-figure figcaption {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 20px;
    color: #454e5e;
  }

  .attorney-cta {
    background: #061633;
    padding: 100px 24px;
  }
  .attorney-cta-inner {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .attorney-cta-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 18px;
    letter-spacing: 1.8px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c9a840;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .attorney-cta-line {
    width: 28px;
    height: 2px;
    background: #c9a840;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .attorney-cta-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 44px;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 50.16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.53px;
    color: #ffffff;
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
  }
  .attorney-cta-text {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 18.08px;
    line-height: 31px;
    color: #c3ccda;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 32px;
  }
  .attorney-cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .attorney-cta-primary,
  .attorney-cta-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 16px 30px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 16.16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 24.24px;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .attorney-cta-primary {
    background: #732521;
  }
  .attorney-cta-primary:hover {
    background: #581b19;
  }
  .attorney-cta-primary svg {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
  }
  .attorney-cta-secondary {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }
  .attorney-cta-secondary:hover {
    border-color: #c9a840;
    color: #ddc582;
  }
  .attorney-cta-links {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    padding-top: 32px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
  .attorney-cta-nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px 24px;
  }
  .attorney-cta-nav a {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 21px;
    color: #c3ccda;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .attorney-cta-nav a:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .attorney-cta-phone {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 24px;
    color: #c9a840;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .attorney-cta-phone:hover {
    color: #ddc582;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .attorney-hero {
      padding: 104px 20px 56px;
    }
    .attorney-title {
      font-size: 40px;
      line-height: 46px;
    }
    .attorney-body {
      padding: 48px 20px;
    }
    .attorney-copy {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 29px;
      padding-bottom: 64px;
    }
    .attorney-figure {
      float: none;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 340px;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
    }
    .attorney-cta {
      padding: 72px 20px;
    }
    .attorney-cta-title {
      font-size: 34px;
      line-height: 40px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .attorney-button,
    .attorney-cta-primary,
    .attorney-cta-secondary,
    .attorney-cta-nav a,
    .attorney-cta-phone {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
